            <div xml:id="d403">

                <pb facs="0506" n="496" sameAs="frus:frus1947v07/pg496"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.00/1–747: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in China</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Stuart</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1947-03-01T08:00:00-05:00">March 1, 1947—8
                            a.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>250. USSR may be in position make out case that it enjoys status belligerent
                    occupant Dairen sense Sec 701 Vol 2 [<hi rendition="#italic">3</hi>] Hyde’s <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Int Law</hi> and that it can claim control there
                    accordance para 4 agreement concerning Dairen until state of war legally
                    terminated by treaty or other appropriate means (Embs despatch 387 Jan 7<anchor
                        n="34" xml:id="d403-f1"/>). However Dept feels Soviet refusal permit
                    restoration Chinese authority Dairen subsequent complete military defeat Japan
                    conflicts with purpose and spirit other provisions treaty and agreements.</p>
                <p>Dept notes Chinese Govt maintaining position that since surrender Japan
                    provisions para 4 Dairen agreement subject implementation (Embtel 196 Feb 4) but
                    apparently attempting achieve opening Dairen before settlement other question
                    (Embtel 257 Feb 12<anchor n="34" xml:id="d403-f2"/>) relative to Changchun
                    Railway. Is it not probable that action would be speeded if the two questions
                    were tackled simultaneously? (Sent Nanking repeated Dairen Mukden Changchun) You
                    may at your discretion mention this thought to Chinese authorities.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Marshall</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
